### =========================================================================
### LOCAL DEVELOPMENT TESTING (localhost:8080)
### =========================================================================

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### USERS COLLECTION - LOCAL
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Get all users
GET http://localhost:8080/users

### Get user by ID (Replace with a valid ID from your local database)
GET http://localhost:8080/users/660a1234567890abcdef1234

### Create a new user account
POST http://localhost:8080/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "Doe",
  "email": "johndoe@example.com",
  "role": "customer"
}

### Update user parameters (Replace URL ID with the ID created from POST)
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/660a1234567890abcdef1234
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "John",
  "lastName": "UpdatedDoe",
  "email": "johndoe_updated@example.com",
  "role": "admin"
}

### Delete a user account (Replace URL ID with a valid database ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/660a1234567890abcdef1234


### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### PRODUCTS COLLECTION - LOCAL
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Fetch complete product catalog
GET http://localhost:8080/products

### Get product specifications by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/products/660b9876543210fedcba4321

### Add a new product to the catalog
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wireless Gaming Mouse",
  "description": "Ergonomic 16000 DPI optical gaming mouse with RGB backlighting.",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 59.99,
  "stock": 120
}

### Modify product details (Replace URL ID with the ID created from POST)
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/660b9876543210fedcba4321
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Wireless Gaming Mouse v2",
  "description": "Upgraded battery life ergonomic wireless mouse.",
  "category": "Electronics",
  "price": 64.99,
  "stock": 95
}

### Remove a product item from listings
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/660b9876543210fedcba4321




